Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:13.24,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,190)\pos(328,267.091)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\fs22\blur4\3c&H444242&}Monday, June 8th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:48.44,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:51.60,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good morning. Did you sleep all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.36,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks for the fresh bathwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:56.50,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:59.02,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,The water was perfect. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.19,0:01:00.87,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.71,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But you don't have to do it again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:04.33,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:06.49,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,It's a waste of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.67,0:01:10.78,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm off to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:58.38,Main,student,0,0,0,,Yo, did you see that horror movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:02:59.40,Main,student,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:02:59.99,Main,student,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:01.53,Main,student,0,0,0,,The one everybody's talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:01.93,Main,student,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:03.13,Main,student,0,0,0,,Hey, I haven't seen it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:04.93,Main - Top,student,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! You gotta go see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:05.48,Main - Top,student,0,0,0,,No way! Go see it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:08.00,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(570,650)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\pos(319.273,269.273)\c&HAEB66B&\b1}Episode 2 {\fs14}"A Deal and a Fried {\c&H814EB2&}Egg{\c&HAEB66B&}"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.91,Main - Top,student,0,0,0,,I'm not really into horror movies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:08.25,Main - Top,student,0,0,0,,Jeez, dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:14.65,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Give it up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:15.94,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Maru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:20.70,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Ayase, right? I know it's not cool to \Ninterfere in someone else's love life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:22.31,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,but I'd advise against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:24.75,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:27.58,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not good enough for \Na babe like her, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:31.86,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,You got it backwards. If you went out \Nwith Ayase, it'd make {\i1}you{\i0} look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.02,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.98,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say I've heard \Nsome unpleasant rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.03,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:42.34,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,That she's a working girl. \NYou know, selling herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:44.03,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.74,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,She's got blonde hair, pierced ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:50.30,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,and a nasty look on her face \Nthat always keeps people away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:54.69,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,It sounds like she's a troublemaker \Nwho doesn't really fit in with her class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:57.99,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Some people even swear they've \Nseen her leaving the love hotel district.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:02.11,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's not like you to believe \Nrumors so easily, Maru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.62,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,One of the guys in the \Nbaseball club asked her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:11.24,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Want to know what she told him?\N"I'm just as bad as the rumors say."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:13.61,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,"I have no intention of dating anyone."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:16.18,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Maybe he was just mad\Nover being shot down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.81,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:21.14,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,I keep hearing the same story \Nfrom guys in other clubs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:25.92,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Each claim by itself is hearsay, but when\Nthey start to pile up, it sounds true, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.95,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Yeah, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:34.86,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Pandora...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.46,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Anyway, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:37.63,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.65,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,You've got a new little sister now, right, {\i1}bro{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:43.30,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.54,Main,Maru,0,0,0,,Crap. Gotta go change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.09,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:53.39,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.98,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,My secret weapon, the Great Celestial Serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.44,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Take... that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.55,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:01.74,Main,girl student 1,0,0,0,,Double fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.38,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Hey, where were you aiming, Maaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:06.08,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:09.13,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Jeez. Why'd you have to hit it so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:11.49,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Because it looks cooler that way! Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:14.56,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,"Tee-hee," my butt, you little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:16.11,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:16.80,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Now I gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:17.71,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,I'm anti-violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.79,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Time for tickle torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.48,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,I give, I give!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:27.17,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:27.17,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You skipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:28.54,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,I regret my actions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:33.42,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You scared me. Why are you talking to me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:32.01,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Do it right this time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.58,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,But I am! I have been from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.89,0:05:37.15,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,When someone I know is skipping, I get worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.26,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,No, you aren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:38.13,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:41.07,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,So the big brother wants to \Nlecture his little sister, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:39.67,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Okay, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.27,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.01,0:05:44.90,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not in any position\Nto be lecturing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.71,0:05:49.34,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I didn't know you'd picked tennis, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:51.16,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Aw, come on! Where are you hitting it? Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.54,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Maaya said we should pick the same sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:53.55,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:56.21,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Of course, that wasn't my only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.11,0:05:55.51,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:57.92,Main - Top,Maaya,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:01.22,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You mean Narasaka-san, right? \NYou two are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:01.61,Main - Top,Yumi,0,0,0,,Hey! Again with that? Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:06.24,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,We are. Although I think Maaya's \Npretty much friends with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:08.22,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:11.70,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Why did you pick tennis, Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.41,0:06:16.52,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It wasn't a very admirable reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:21.58,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't mind. My other reason \Nis pretty pathetic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.89,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Because there aren't any team matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:30.71,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't like depending on anyone \Nor anyone depending on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:33.59,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh. We really do think alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:39.00,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't want to play a team \Nsport in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.26,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I usually try to keep my \Ndistance from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:46.70,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Do you, maybe... have trouble \Nfitting in with your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:47.85,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:52.99,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I always imagined that stylish girls \Nlike you would be the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:55.01,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't really mind it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:07:00.54,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,If people leave me alone, \Nthat just gives me more time to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:04.02,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Like time to listen to music?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.03,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:06.94,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.51,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:14.41,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuta-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:16.84,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, I just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:20.41,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,Welcome home. I made dinner for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.25,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:25.23,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you do all that before work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:29.33,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NYou don't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:32.68,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,But dealing with customers\Nmust be exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:37.34,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, I do deal with customers, \Nbut I'm actually the bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.34,0:07:39.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:44.76,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'd better get going. Let's talk about \Ndinner arrangements another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:45.86,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:48.63,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,Please keep an eye on Saki for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.77,0:07:50.50,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.61,Main,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.62,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.37,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:23.77,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You can come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.49,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:30.16,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:33.43,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.89,0:08:37.93,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, were you studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:39.86,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,This is bad for your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:40.82,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:44.48,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You're able to juggle work and school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:47.23,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is that really so strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.32,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:56.01,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you know any easy part-time \Njobs that pay really well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:01.77,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I need more money, but I don't \Nwant to waste a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.27,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe like an hour or two of \Nwork for 10,000 yen or more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.81,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Think that's doable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:12.37,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I don't think you'll find \Nany normal jobs like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:16.05,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Really? I guess I gotta keep selling, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.16,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Selling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:20.80,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I read in a book that if you want to make\Ngood money, you should sell yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:27.88,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,This might be really rude to say, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:32.55,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't mind. Go ahead. \NI'm the one who asked, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:37.55,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think you should take \Nbetter care of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.33,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I already take good care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:44.90,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I want \Nto earn lots of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:50.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Would you be able to say \Nthat in front of your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:52.57,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.89,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,It'd probably make her happy. \NShe'd be like, "You've really grown up!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:58.51,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,What a way to raise your kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:10:00.40,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:05.45,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Wasn't your father thrilled \Nwhen you first got into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:08.19,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,If he was, that'd be a huge problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:11.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,But wait, why are you talking \Nlike I'm doing it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.96,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something \Nabout a job yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:17.94,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:22.93,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.31,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.\NYour food's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.47,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised you\N were confused about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:33.07,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I know what people think. \NI know they wonder why I dress like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:36.02,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,It's my armed mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:36.74,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:43.12,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,For me, these clothes are the armaments \Nthat help me survive in society.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.20,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.94,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,So do they raise your defense stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:50.57,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Or let you dual attack or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.27,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You're pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:53.46,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:57.09,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess that's more or less right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.53,0:11:01.99,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,We face battles all the time. \NEven if you don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.47,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Did you see my mom today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:07.79,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.53,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Doesn't she look pretty when she goes to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:16.16,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well... yeah. She sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:21.86,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\fax-.3\shad0\frz351.3\frx24\fry358\3c&H867B78&\c&H192C10&\move(346,62.667,348,91.334)}Saki and Yuta-kun,\NHeat this up and eat it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:19.97,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You know, she only graduated high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.86,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.19,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:25.78,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:29.67,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh. You sure are level-headed, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.44,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I've heard plenty from people\Nwho aren't so neutral.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.91,0:11:38.24,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,A beautiful woman with a high school\Neducation who works in nightlife...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:43.52,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,People say she's just stupid and \Nweaponizes her looks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:48.92,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I've heard people say that \Nabout my mom so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.89,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:53.64,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Right? It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:55.05,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:12:01.43,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,And it's so dirty when people try to \Nuse that kind of logic to corner you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.91,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:07.58,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,If you're smart but not pretty,\N they label you a snobby, overeducated woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.82,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,If you have good looks but aren't smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:12.77,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,they say you're a gold digger \Nwho's using her body to get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.77,0:12:17.26,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,If a pretty woman relies on a man, \Nthey say she's a parasite who has it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:22.00,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But if she works hard for herself, they call \Nher a pathetic loser with no man to rely on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.84,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I see what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:29.83,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,So anyway, that's why I arm \Nmyself with these clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:33.87,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I need my look to be perfect\Nto make me stand out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:38.15,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,before I have the strength to be \Nperfect at school and work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:40.88,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,This is the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:47.52,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that? \NIt sounds utterly exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:51.11,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Even if it takes tons of energy, as long\Nas I can prove them wrong, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:53.52,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Prove them wrong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:55.53,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,But who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:12.18,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Aren't you like me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:19.59,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not as strong as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:22.73,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:26.65,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,you don't want anyone relying on you \Nor to rely on anyone else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.27,0:13:29.91,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,If you want to free yourself \Nof those expectations,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:33.30,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,you need to be strong enough \Nto get by in life alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:38.17,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is that why you're looking for a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:41.92,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,So you can live independently, \Nwithout relying on anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:44.78,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.46,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.37,0:14:01.56,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.52,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll see if I can get you\Nsome info about jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:05.62,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:08.50,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,My senpai at work might have some ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:09.68,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll ask her tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.45,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:14.99,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But I don't want to make you \Ndo everything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:16.45,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:19.85,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,No, it isn't. At least not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.62,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay, how about miso soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:27.87,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.51,0:14:31.02,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I want you to make me miso soup every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.85,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Is that your idea of a love confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.60,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, no. That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.13,0:14:42.15,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,But today was the first time in years \NI had miso soup that wasn't instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.15,0:14:44.26,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It was really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:50.23,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I know Akiko-san has to work, \Nso that'd be asking a lot of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.07,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:57.47,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't really mind cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:03.71,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll look for job leads to help you \Nbecome independent, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:08.19,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. And I'll cook for you, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:19.02,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,820)\fs14\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\3c&H444242&\c&HFFFDE7&\pos(123.733,231.758)}Tuesday, June 9th
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.82,Main,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yuta, you won't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:19.13,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're gonna wake Akiko-san up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:21.02,Main,Taichi,0,0,0,,But S-Saki-chan is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:25.02,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.49,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.07,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Why? We made a deal yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.98,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that was about dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:38.06,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I figured I might as well make breakfast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:42.42,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,It's my personal policy \Nto give more than I take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:45.20,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:52.80,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&HB9B4A9&\pos(402.667,158)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.96,Main,Taichi,0,0,0,,Saki-chan, thanks for breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:51.48,Main,Taichi,0,0,0,,It was delicious! I'm so impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:52.80,Main,Taichi,0,0,0,,I'm off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.80,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.63,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, no, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.07,0:16:00.77,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,You can be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:06.27,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, really. I'm just used to eating \Nfried eggs with soy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.45,0:16:09.27,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.27,0:16:12.95,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,We've always used salt and pepper. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:16.75,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's fine! You had no way of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:19.91,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's my fault for not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.91,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll try to ask ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.90,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll try to keep you informed \Nabout stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:28.60,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.68,0:16:35.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I had no idea you were so into \Nself-improvement, my sweet junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.93,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnARial\fs8\fax-.3\shad0\b1\frz17.55\3c&H66C7CC&\c&H6B25A8&\move(236,270,246,280.667,1777,2140)}Super Moneymaking
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:37.83,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:41.07,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, this is something else. How do I explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:41.68,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.21,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I want to live on my own \Nafter graduating high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.11,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,so I need to save up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:49.38,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, no wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.50,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Now that I have a little sister at my age,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:57.07,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,living at home might get a little cramped.\NEspecially since we're the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.21,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can understand wanting to live on your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.56,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,but it isn't actually \Nbecause of your sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:04.70,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,It isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:09.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it could be, \Nbut it just seems like a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.35,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Having a sister your age \Ncould be a great asset!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:34.55,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,If you can't get by on your own, I think \Nit's perfectly fine to rely on someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.33,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Even if I become a burden on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:46.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You know, some people actually \Nprefer women who are a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:48.34,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, that's just personal preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:51.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It definitely is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:54.26,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But listen, that's what money is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:18:00.26,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\frz201.4\fnArial\fs15\b1\shad0\fax-.1\pos(364.666,273.334)\c&H4814D4&\3c&HF6F6FB&}Super Moneymaking
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:18:00.26,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs10\b1\shad0\fax-.1\fay-.03\c&H1D464F&\3c&H1BBFFC&\pos(336,172.001)\frz201.4}Earn More the Smart Way\N{\bord1\fs8\3c&HF6F6FB&}Investment Tips You Should Know
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.06,0:17:57.69,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's nice if you have it, \Nbut if not, that's fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:18:00.26,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just find someone to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:02.78,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is that all there is to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:10.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Even rich CEOs are more dependent on \Nother people than you might imagine, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:12.60,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't talk like you know. It's not a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:18.23,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You don't think a charming college girl like \Nmyself would have a sugar daddy or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:24.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:26.20,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.45,0:18:32.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, why don't you rethink \Ndepending on your family a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.12,0:18:38.61,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,The right way to depend on people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:39.59,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:44.18,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm still looking for leads on jobs, \Nbut I thought this might be useful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.68,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had any \Nclose female friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:51.77,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's what you got from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.22,0:18:53.68,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:54.92,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:59.99,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,She sounds like the lovely, friendly, \Nvery intelligent older sister type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.72,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:07.55,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,I think what she said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:09.37,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:14.09,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But I still want to become self-reliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.20,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,You don't feel like you can \Ndepend on me and my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:25.76,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,No, I know you're wonderful people. \NI think you're both very dependable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.07,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:35.87,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,this whole thing might have been easier \Nif you were terrible people instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:37.19,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:40.72,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry. Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:13.19,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,360)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\blur4\3c&H444242&\pos(320,257.091)\c&HFAF6EE&}Wednesday, June 10th
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.34,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,Aw, Maaya, that's way too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:13.25,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Tee-hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:15.54,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,"Tee-hee," my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:18.54,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,If you do that again, I'm gonna get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:21.75,Main,Saki,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:23.13,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.55,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,I think I'm starting to get the hang of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:31.31,Flashback,Yuta,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:33.64,Flashback,Yuta,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:39.26,Flashback,Yuta,0,0,0,,You think I can just let it go when you \Ndo things that could get you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:44.42,Flashback,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:49.47,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's gonna start soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:51.17,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,It looks fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.17,0:21:52.90,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff, sniff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.80,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,See, this is what it smells \Nlike before it rains!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:57.19,Main,Yumi,0,0,0,,That's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.90,Main,Maaya,0,0,0,,Two hundred percent accurate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:53.44,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:55.99,Main,Yuta,0,0,0,,Or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:17.94,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,We face battles all the time. \NEven if you don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:22.49,Flashback - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,As long as I can prove\N them wrong, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:31.05,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\fax.4\shad0\bord1\c&H4F6561&\frz15.65\3c&HB1ECDD&\pos(261.999,172)}One New Message
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:50.07,Main,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&HB5D375&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 3 {\fs14}"Reflection and {\c&HAB77D7&}Re{\c&HB5D375&}vision"
